      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's perfect, that's exactly the level of sophistication i'm looking for. it really makes their position seem irredeemable. \n\non that note, i've been seeing a lot of people online saying the book is just \"partisan propaganda\" because of how it treats that specific group. do you think those critics are just too close to the issue to see the objective truth the author is presenting, or is there any actual merit to their argument that the book is one-sided?",
